 current-start and renewal regression evidence is reported with its exact
 selection and source bindings; it is not a skipped-P04 full-suite acceptance.
 Portable successful-E history and a fresh complete CLI result remain pending.
+
+## V09 External Completion and Demonstration
+
+This continuation is an external candidate, not owner landing or a new Gate.
+The review package's final source ledger, command receipts and node phases are
+the exact implementation/evidence pins. Earlier paragraphs and counts above
+retain their historical source provenance. Full Testflix acceptance is not
+self-awarded by this addendum.
+
+### Validation and Domain Boundaries
+
+The existing Host material-validation scope now spans directly related pure D
+cell execution and D/E validation bodies. It does not surround the Testflix
+handler, a source refresh, a model/provider callback or a business effect.
+Every public entry still checks actual and saved capture origin, retained
+ordinal, material edges and the requested current/historical mode. Independent
+supplied validation begins its own scope; exceptions end the scope. No public
+trust flag, persistent permission cache, Root law or evidence identity rule is
+introduced. The V08 exact ABI-record and frozen-slot coverage is preserved.
+
+The reprice consumer binds actual completed work to its observed-work binding
+artifact, not to the distinct context identifier. A negative consent review uses
+the existing Root failure vocabulary; a false candidate does not manufacture
+an identity failure. Serializable domain action evidence excludes Host/source
+handles and executable admission callbacks, retaining the actual receipt and
+public admission snapshot. Canonical stored writeback bytes are checked before
+their redundant copy is omitted, consistently with historical history export.
+
+The controlled story keeps four independent Hosts, an immutable paid period and
+historical packet/baseline. The 500 and 600 positive controls are independent
+branches, not extra main-story payments. A 700 reprice under consent 650 cannot
+charge; renewal requires its own explicit sufficient consent. Evidence files
+and complete test phases, not attached E labels, establish the tested cases.
+
+### Semantic Modes
+
+The legacy `CONTROLLED_DETERMINISTIC` profile remains available with its original
+bounded semantics. `CONTROLLED_ROLE_DUTIES` is a separate offline control, never
+claimed as live evidence. Four distinct roles are used by the new live/captured
+path:
+
+- `intent_interpreter`: stated preference, priorities and missing intent evidence.
+- `provider_terms_analyst`: exact supplied catalog facts and eligibility.
+- `client_plan_selector`: an affordable proposal consuming intent and terms.
+- `contract_reviewer`: an independent consistency review or explicit disagreement.
+
+The model returns closed semantic fields only. A trusted local adapter binds the
+exact request, role-specific projection, raw response and canonical response to
+the capture. Downstream roles receive the needed upstream outputs and capture
+references. Missing required evidence, an unknown/over-budget selection or a
+review disagreement stops before action. None of these roles issues Root
+permission. Private Bank/User canaries are excluded from model projections.
+
+`LIVE_CAPTURED` records actual configured-provider responses. The shared attempt
+ledger initially permitted 10 main, 6 A/B and 16 total attempts. After an actual
+four-role A/B disagreement the owner explicitly expanded the request allowance.
+This candidate conservatively caps the shared ledger at 10 main, 10 A/B and 20
+total attempts, including failures; the next explicit selection is four calls,
+not an unlimited retry loop. Historical 16-call records remain unchanged;
+automatic transport retries and controlled fallback are disabled. The configured
+model/account is not changed. Captures contain no credential values.
+
+`CAPTURED_REEXECUTION` consumes those exact input-bound responses through the
+same handler with freshly constructed genuine Hosts and mock effects. It is
+not equivalent to just opening an old seal. Offline sealed-history replay is
+separately verified to make no provider or effect calls, and infers no present
+permission. Capture JSON cannot recreate a previous process's Host origin.
+
+For QUALITY, every role receives the same finite ordered preference definition:
+affordable catalog entries, resolution first, then advertising/price/plan-id
+tie-breakers. Missing or contradictory model evidence still refuses; a prompt
+definition is not an acceptance override. The AD_FREE projection remains exact.
+
+The new serialized domain report/history profiles are `testflix.p01.v02` and
+`testflix.history.v02`; their semantic generation mode and evidence class remain
+explicit. Actual model transport is live, while catalog facts, trusted test time
+and business effects remain controlled. This is not provider-truth attestation,
+OS monitoring, a real subscription purchase or physical device control.
+
+### Explicit Operator Commands
+
+Use the existing environment and run from the independent candidate with its
+directory on `PYTHONPATH`. Live runs need explicit authorization and available
+attempt budget; these examples are not an automatic continuation script.
+
+```sh
+python -B demo/run_testflix_v01.py live --input demo/testflix_fixtures_v01.json --output <new-output-directory> --captures <shared-attempt-directory> --config <existing-local-config> --renewal
+python -B demo/run_testflix_v01.py captured --input demo/testflix_fixtures_v01.json --output <new-output-directory> --semantic-records <recorded-semantic-records.json> --renewal
+python -B demo/run_testflix_v01.py replay --input <sealed-history.json> --expected-manifest-hash <reviewed-pin>
+python -B demo/run_testflix_v01.py render --input <actual-story.json> --output <story.html>
+```
+
+The static viewer renders actual request, role, Root, reprice, renewal and replay
+evidence. It makes no network calls. The renewed period's new informational
+summary is still explicitly unsupported; the original expired summary is not
+presented as current. Finite controlled/live examples are not proof that every
+arbitrary future domain or program is admitted. Exact cumulative common-runtime
+review and owner admission/apply remain separate, with no automatic commit/push.
